genbu-robot (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Switch Docker bringup to Docker Compose.
  * Install docker-compose.yml to /etc/genbu-robot/.
  * Update genbu-robot-start to use docker compose up/pull.
  * Update systemd ExecStop to use docker compose down.

